{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261102/photo/bkn-20261102153146911-1102_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261102153924\"/><p>王文濤（圖）將偕王毅主持APEC雙部長視像會議。</p><p>外交部發言人周一（2日）宣布，中共中央政治局委員、外交部長王毅與商務部長王文濤將於周二（3日）在北京，共同主持亞太經合組織（APEC）第37屆外交和貿易雙部長視像會議。</p><p>外交部發言人另宣布，王毅將於周二至周三（4日）在北京主持瀾滄江—湄公河合作第十一次外長會。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:00:47.295402+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T07:31:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T15:58:35.105100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T07:58:20.855054+00:00","content_hash":"e9c23d4f33608260a2f5106f0a174b266a8825a0610e517ef7b63be66dc04914","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}